                "text": "Yesterday I spoke at the ribbon cutting of the new Graham Co. Hospital Clinic. Access to hospitals in rural areas is critical to Kansans. I made certain rural health was part of reconciliation conversations & supported the bill which included federal assistance to support and stabilize rural providers for hospitals.",
