                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On Monday, I continued my Kansas Hospitals tour with a visit to the Rawlins County Health Center in Atwood. I met with CEO Lucretia Stargell and discussed the Rural Health Transformation fund I helped secure in the One Big Beautiful Bill Act, which provides increased funding to rural hospitals in need. \n\nThanks to everyone at the health center for hosting me & for their dedication to keeping Kansans healthy.",
