                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week, I continued my Kansas hospitals tour with visits to the Kiowa District Hospital, Comanche County Hospital in Coldwater and Stafford County Hospital in Stafford. The staff gave me a tour of their facilities, and we discussed the life-saving health services they provide to their communities as well as my ongoing efforts to make certain that rural Kansas hospitals receive the support they need to keep their doors open. \n\nThank you to the staff at each of the hospitals for their dedication to keeping Kansans healthy.",
