                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, I continued my Kansas Hospitals tour at Sedan City Hospital & met with staff & local leaders to learn more about the services they provide as a 10-bed, city-owned Critical Access Hospital. From X-rays to physical therapy to emergency services, Sedan City Hospital has helped make certain that essential health care remains available to the community since it first opened in the 1950s. I\u2019m grateful to the Sedan City Hospital team and community leadership for their continued commitment to serving patients in Chautauqua & Elk Counties.",
